      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/eastford_connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Early settlement traced to Wabbaquasset Nipmuck lands, crossed by the Old Connecticut Path later used by Massachusetts colonists.",
